      "text": "[6:55AM]  #AgegeMotorRd\n#TrafficUpdate\n\nTraffic from Iyana Dopemu to Ajayi farm is good to go, Ajayi farm inward Ikeja along is slow due to flashflood at Ikeja Along.\nIkeja Along down to Bolade Oshodi is still very good to go.\nIle-zik connecting Sule junction is looking good. \n\nThe return journey on the entire stretch is still in good shape.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
